# GitHub Linguist Language Configuration
# Mark TypeScript/JavaScript tooling and frontend web assets as vendored/ignored in language stats
*.ts linguist-vendored
*.tsx linguist-vendored
*.js linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-vendored
src/** linguist-vendored
scripts/** linguist-vendored
releases/** linguist-vendored
dist/** linguist-vendored
dist-release/** linguist-vendored

# Explicitly detect Kotlin code as primary repository language
*.kt linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=Kotlin
*.kts linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=Kotlin
